@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title MLMS - Submission to Released Mark (swimlanes)
|Student|
start
:Log in;
:Select assignment;
:Submit or resubmit work;
|System|
:Check role, enrolment and closed status;
:Resolve effective deadline\n(original / class / individual);
if (Already submitted?) then (yes)
  if (Before deadline and unmarked?) then (yes)
    :Add new version, keep old ones;
  else (no)
    :Reject resubmission;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Create submission (SUBMITTED or LATE);
endif
:Write audit record (one transaction);
|Lecturer|
:Open submissions after the deadline;
:Enter raw mark and feedback;
|System|
:Validate range 0..max;
:Calculate late days and penalty;
:Save mark AWAITING_MODERATION + audit;
|HoD|
:Review marks for own department;
if (Decision?) then (return)
  :Enter reason;
  |System|
  :Set RETURNED + decision + audit;
  |Lecturer|
  :Correct mark with reason;
  |System|
  :Back to AWAITING_MODERATION + audit;
  |HoD|
  :Approve;
else (approve / amend)
endif
|System|
:Set APPROVED + decision + audit;
|HoD|
:Release assignment;
|System|
if (Every submission approved?) then (yes)
  :Set RELEASED in one transaction + audit;
else (no)
  :Refuse whole batch, nothing released;
  stop
endif
|Student|
:View mark and feedback;
stop
@enduml
